LunaAgent - macOS 13+ (Beta)
============================

Version: __VERSION__

What you get
------------
- /Applications/LunaAgent.app (daemon, WireGuard helper, and tools inside)
- SMAppService: login item, lunaagentd, luna-wghelper
- Full SwiftUI UI (metrics, tabs)
- No /usr/local scatter

First launch
------------
Complete Finish setup. Approve Background / Login Items under
System Settings -> General -> Login Items & Extensions when asked.

Uninstall
---------
Move LunaAgent to Trash. SMAppService jobs leave with the app.
Enrollment may remain under ~/Library/Application Support/LunaAgent.

Docs: https://github.com/mxxnly/Luna-Agent/blob/main/docs/install-13plus.md

Do not use this package on macOS 10.14-12 - use LunaAgent_Legacy_10.14.pkg.
